#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"The SEPA payment will be debited from your account within the next few days. \n"
"\n"
"We will debit your subsequent %(debit_period)s payments on the %(payment_day)s. %(debit_period_schedule)s. If the due date falls on a weekend or a holiday, the debit date will be postponed to the next working day. Please make sure you have sufficient funds to avoid return debit fees.\n"
"\n"
"Details of your SEPA Direct Debit Mandate at a glance:\n"
"\n"
"Amount: %(amount)s EUR\n"
"SEPA-Mandate-Reference: %(sepa_mandate)s\n"
"Creditor-ID: %(sepa_creditor)s\n"
"\n"
"Your Account: \n"
"Account Holder: %(account_holder)s\n"
"IBAN: %(iban)s\n"
" \n"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "(PF5)"
msgid " Almost done! Please enter your account information below."
msgstr ""

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MS9)"
msgid "(%(amount)s Euro per month)"
msgstr ""

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL1a)"
msgid "(MAIL1a) with variables: %(portal_name)s %(next_debit_date)s %(payment_amount)s %(payment_debit_period)s"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your Contribution! We’re happy to welcome you as a supporter of %(portal_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"You have set up a Contribution amount of **%(payment_amount)s Euro %(payment_debit_period)s**. The first payment has just been made, for which you will receive a separate email confirmation.\n"
"\n"
"The next debit will be made on %(next_debit_date)s. Please make sure that your account has sufficient funds."

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL1b)"
msgid "(MAIL1b) with variables: %(portal_name)s %(next_debit_date)s %(payment_amount)s %(payment_debit_period)s"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your Contribution! We’re happy to welcome you as a supporter of %(portal_name)s!\n"
"\n"
"You have replaced your current Contribution with a new Contribution amount of **%(payment_amount)s Euro %(payment_debit_period)s**. The first payment with your new payment information has just been made, for which you will receive a separate email confirmation.\n"
"\n"
"The next debit will be made on %(next_debit_date)s. Please make sure that your account has sufficient funds."

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL1s)"
msgid "(MAIL1s) with variables: %(portal_name)s"
msgstr "Your Contribution for %(portal_name)s"

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL2)"
msgid "(MAIL2) with variables: %(payment_method)s %(payment_amount)s %(vat_amount)s %(payment_debit_period)s"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your contribution! We have just initiated the debiting of your %(payment_debit_period)s contribution.\n"
"\n"
"Total amount (incl. %(vat_amount)s%% VAT): **%(payment_amount)s EUR**\n"
"Payment method: %(payment_method)s"

msgctxt "(MAIL2s)"
msgid "(MAIL2s) with variables: -"
msgstr "Your Contribution"

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL3)"
msgid "(MAIL3) with variables: %(subscription_amount)s %(next_debit_date)s %(subscription_debit_period)s"
msgstr ""
"You have changed your contribution to %(subscription_amount)s Euro %(subscription_debit_period)s.\n"
"\n"
"The next debit will be made on %(next_debit_date)s. Please make sure that your account has sufficient funds."

msgctxt "(MAIL3s)"
msgid "(MAIL3s) with variables: -"
msgstr "Your Contribution was changed"

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL4)"
msgid "(MAIL4) with variables: %(portal_name)s %(link_new_payment)s %(support_email)s"
msgstr ""
"We regret you stopped making your payments. We thank you for your support of our work so far and hope that you will remain loyal to %(portal_name)s.\n"
"\n"
"If you just want to change your payment details, please click here and set up the payment again: %(link_new_payment)s\n"
"\n"
"If you are dissatisfied with %(portal_name)s, please send your constructive feedback to %(support_email)s!"

msgctxt "(MAIL4s)"
msgid "(MAIL4s) with variables: -"
msgstr "Your payments were terminated"

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL5)"
msgid "(MAIL5) with variables: %(portal_name)s %(link_new_payment)s %(link_payment_issues)s %(subscription_debit_period)s"
msgstr ""
"Due to an error we could not debit your %(subscription_debit_period)s Contribution! For further details, please click here: %(link_payment_issues)s\n"
"\n"
"Your %(subscription_debit_period)s contribution is hereby suspended. \n"
"\n"
"To continue your Contribution and support %(portal_name)s, please set up a new payment: %(link_new_payment)s\n"
"\n"
"Please make sure that your account is still valid and has sufficient funds!"

msgctxt "(MAIL5s)"
msgid "(MAIL5s) with variables: -"
msgstr "Your payments were suspended"

#, python-format
msgctxt "(MAIL6)"
msgid "(MAIL6) with variables: %(portal_name)s %(iban)s %(sepa_mandate)s %(sepa_creditor)s %(next_debit_date)s %(subscription_amount)s %(support_email)s"
msgstr ""
"You hereby receive the SEPA direct debit advance notice for the debit of your next %(portal_name)s Contribution:\n"
"\n"
"Bank account (IBAN): %(iban)s\n"
"SEPA mandate reference: %(sepa_mandate)s\n"
"Creditor identification number: %(sepa_creditor)s\n"
" \n"
"Debit date: %(next_debit_date)s\n"
"Total amount: %(subscription_amount)s EUR\n"
"\n"
"The amount will be debited from the above account after the debit date.\n"
"\n"
"For legal reasons we are obliged to inform you about every SEPA direct debit in advance. This is an automatically generated email.\n"
"\n"
"If you have any questions please contact %(support_email)s."

