msgctxt "(PF14)"
msgid ""
"This is possible because other users are co-financing you.\n"
"\t\n"
"\tIn order to operate and further develop %(portal_name)s on a permanent cost-covering basis, we are dependent on voluntary contributions from our users.\n"
"\t\n"
"\tWith an average monthly contribution of 5 Euro, we can cover the costs of hosting the platform. Therefore, we are grateful if some give a little more to co-finance others.\n"
"\t\n"
"\tHere you can set your contribution to support %(portal_name)s. We automatically collect the contribution according to the selected debiting period. You can choose between direct debit and credit card.\n"
"\t\n"
"\tYou can change or terminate your contribution at any time by clicking on \"Your Contribution\" in your user menu.\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"This is possible because other users co-finance you. Please contribute to the operation, maintenance and development of the platform.\n"
"\n"
"With 7 € per person per month we can cover the costs of running the platform. However, since we know that this contribution is not feasible for everyone, we are relying on a solidarity model: everyone gives what they can afford. Therefore, we are happy if some give a little more to help finance others. We thank you for your contribution!\n"
"\n"
"You can set your monthly contribution here to support %(portal_name)s privately or as an organization. We will automatically collect your contribution once a month and you will receive an invoice. You can choose between direct debit and credit card.\n"
"\n"
"You can change, suspend or cancel your monthly contribution at any time by clicking on \"Your contribution\" in your user menu.\n"

