msgctxt "(POP3-newuser)"
msgid ""
"it's great to have you WECHANGE! We hope you like our platform and that you and your projects can benefit.\n"
"\n"
"We try to optimally fullfill your needs and the demands of the community and to develop the platform. This causes high costs - for hosting, maintenance, support and the development of new functions. In order to ensure the maintenance, we rely on voluntary contributions from our users.\n"
"\n"
"With every Euro you spend, you help us to make WECHANGE better. With an average of 5 Euros per month, we can cover the costs of hosting the platform, everything above contributes directly to further development. If you can contribute less or nothing at all, we're sure you have good reasons. But please remember: This is only possible because other users support you!\n"
msgstr ""
"We are happy that you have chosen wechange.de. We hope that you like our platform and that it will be useful for you and your project.\n"
"\n"
"We make the platform available to everyone for a voluntary contribution. This contribution ensures that everyone can use wechange.de safely and without advertising and it ensures the maintenance, operation and further development of the platform. The guideline value is € 7 per person per month, so that the platform can be carried by the members alone. Since we know that this contribution is not feasible for all, we rely on solidarity: Everyone gives what he:she they can afford.\n"
"\n"
"We thank you for your contribution!\n"

msgid "monthly"
msgstr ""

msgid "quarterly"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "(POP3-release)"
msgid ""
"we consider WECHANGE a common good: Therefore we decided that, from now on, you will be able to open new groups and use all group functions with your teams, for free!\n"
"\n"
"Correspondingly, we invite you to pay for the use of WECHANGE whatever feels right. Even with a very small contribution, you help us making WECHANGE better. With an average of 5 Euros per month you enable us to cover the costs of hosting the platform. Beyond that your share is dedicated to further development."
msgstr ""
"we consider wechange.de a common good: Therefore we decided that, from now on, you will be able to open new groups and use all group functions with your teams, for free!\n"
"\n"
"Correspondingly, we invite you to pay for the use of wechange.de whatever feels right. Even with a very small contribution, you help us making wechange.de better. With an average of 7 Euros per month you enable us to cover the costs of hosting the platform. Beyond that your share is dedicated to further development."

msgid "yearly"
msgstr ""

#, python-format
msgctxt "(POP3-repeat)"
msgid ""
"you joined us at WECHANGE %(join_time_verbal)s - we are very happy about that! \n"
"\n"
"Please remember: WECHANGE is only free of charge because enough users* contribute voluntarily. With an average of 5 Euro per month, we can cover the costs of hosting the platform. Every small contribution helps!"
msgstr ""
"You joined us at wechange.de %(join_time_verbal)s - we are very happy about that! \n"
"\n"
"We hope wechange.de will be a strong supporter of your project. Now it’s time to support wechange.de by making your voluntary contribution. With € 7 per person per month we can cover the costs of running the platform. You give what you can afford and contribute to the creation of new projects on wechange.de every day to drive change. We thank you for your contribution!\n"
"\n"
"PS: Organizations and groups can also contribute and receive an invoice for their payment. If you have any questions, please contact our support at support@wechange.de!."

